## Hero

**Heading:** Signal Integrity (SI) & Power Integrity (PI) Analysis Services

**Body:** Pre- and post-layout signal and power integrity analysis before a single board is fabricated, using Cadence Sigrity and Ansys SIwave. Transmission-line simulation, eye-diagram analysis, IBIS-based driver/receiver modeling, and PDN impedance analysis.

